		{
			dependencies: ["538A1BBC9A1B8EAC"]
			description: ["A stone that remembers where you stood. Set one down, and the distance between here and anywhere else you've claimed stops mattering - step through, not across. Whoever built the first one wasn't thinking about convenience. They were thinking about how far they'd have to run if it all went wrong."]
