			dependencies: ["7D3A5F912E6C0B48"]
			description: ["The stand's been waiting a long time for something to hold. Set the pendant down and the wall stops being a wall - for you, anyway. You lose whatever it was giving you, but you can cross the border now. Just remember the pedestal's what's being watched, not you - don't leave it standing alone too long."]
