		{
			dependencies: ["1454951A7FB14A26"]
			description: ["An Auto-Turret picks its own targets in range and fires without you doing anything, real unlimited ammo despite how it looks - nothing to restock. First thing in this place that can actually watch a wall while you're somewhere else. It spawns facing a random direction until it finds something to shoot, and it can wander off its post if nothing's around to fight for a while - don't expect it to hold one fixed spot forever."]
