		{
			dependencies: ["689899208FC0ADF0"]
			description: ["Five waves was as far as whoever held this post before you got. You have matched that, and the gear has finally given out - it was never going to last past this point anyway. Eight was the last wave anyone bothered planning for - after that, it just keeps escalating, no ceiling anyone has found yet. Whatever gear and defenses you have built by now are what you are taking into it. I do not know how far it actually goes. Maybe you will be the one who finds out."]
